<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>H&M Accessories</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
rel="stylesheet">

<link rel="stylesheet"
href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"/>

<style>

*{
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
}

body{
  background:#fff;
  color:#111;
}

.hero{
  width:100%;
  height:90vh;
  position:relative;
}

.hero img{
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  object-fit:cover;
}

.overlay{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
}

.hero-content{
  position:absolute;
  top:50%;
  left:8%;
  transform:translateY(-50%);
  color:#fff;
}

.hero-content h1{
  font-size:72px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero-content p{
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.7;
  margin-bottom:30px;
  max-width:600px;
}

.hero-content button{
  padding:15px 35px;
  border:none;
  background:#fff;
  font-weight:700;
  cursor:pointer;
}

.section{
  padding:80px 8%;
}

.section-title{
  text-align:center;
  margin-bottom:50px;
}

.section-title h2{
  font-size:42px;
  margin-bottom:15px;
}

.product-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
  gap:30px;
}

.product-card{
  border-radius:18px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  transition:0.4s;
}

.product-card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.product-card img{
  width:100%;
  height:420px;
  object-fit:cover;
}

.product-info{
  padding:24px;
}

.product-info h3{
  margin-bottom:10px;
}

.product-info p{
  color:#666;
  line-height:1.7;
  margin-bottom:15px;
}

.price{
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

.new-price{
  font-size:24px;
  font-weight:800;
}

.old-price{
  text-decoration:line-through;
  color:#888;
  margin-left:10px;
}

.buttons{
  display:flex;
  gap:12px;
}

.buttons button{
  flex:1;
  padding:14px;
  border:none;
  cursor:pointer;
  border-radius:8px;
  font-weight:700;
}

.cart-btn{
  background:#111;
  color:#fff;
}

.buy-btn{
  background:#f3f3f3;
}

footer{
  background:#111;
  color:#fff;
  text-align:center;
  padding:35px;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529139574466-a303027c1d8b?q=80&w=1600">

<div class="overlay"></div>

<div class="hero-content">

<h1>ACCESSORIES</h1>

<p>
Discover premium handbags, sunglasses, watches and fashion accessories inspired by modern H&M styling.
</p>

<button>SHOP NOW</button>

</div>

</section>

<section class="section">

<div class="section-title">

<h2>Trending Accessories</h2>

<p>Luxury accessories collection curated for modern fashion.</p>

</div>

<div class="product-grid">

<div class="product-card">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511499767150-a48a237f0083?q=80&w=1200">

<div class="product-info">

<h3>Luxury Sunglasses</h3>

<p>
Premium modern sunglasses with stylish lightweight frame.
</p>

<div class="price">

<span class="new-price">₹1,999</span>

<span class="old-price">₹2,999</span>

</div>

<div class="buttons">

<button class="cart-btn">Add to Cart</button>

<button class="buy-btn">Buy Now</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="product-card">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523170335258-f5ed11844a49?q=80&w=1200">

<div class="product-info">

<h3>Classic Watch</h3>

<p>
Elegant premium watch designed for timeless fashion styling.
</p>

<div class="price">

<span class="new-price">₹3,499</span>

<span class="old-price">₹5,299</span>

</div>

<div class="buttons">

<button class="cart-btn">Add to Cart</button>

<button class="buy-btn">Buy Now</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="product-card">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?q=80&w=1200">

<div class="product-info">

<h3>Premium Sneakers</h3>

<p>
Luxury casual sneakers crafted for comfort and modern streetwear.
</p>

<div class="price">

<span class="new-price">₹4,299</span>

<span class="old-price">₹6,499</span>

</div>

<div class="buttons">

<button class="cart-btn">Add to Cart</button>

<button class="buy-btn">Buy Now</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<footer>
© 2026 H&M Accessories Collection
</footer>

</body>
</html>
